{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.0.2","notes":"Start fresh: a button at the top of every chat writes a short handoff, saves it to the project vault and continues in a new, lighter chat. Nexus also offers this by itself when a chat gets long (120k tokens per message, change it in Settings > Save tokens).","payload":"","signature":"C7Gb0GYhphmL0wTaHF6BZw0GMymPyj/KIIrGpoy029bfUH9c8GGIzEfLpoNFXb7EEphQbCzVC6hKdvbSClRSAA=="}